# Frontend conventions

Work only in `apps/frontend/`. Follow feature-based layout under `src/features/<feature>/`.

## Structure per feature

```
features/<name>/
  <name>.schema.ts   # Zod schemas + inferred types (API shapes)
  <name>.api.ts      # fetch functions via lib/api-client
  <Name>Page.tsx     # route-level UI
  hooks/             # optional feature hooks
```

Shared UI goes in `src/components/`. Cross-cutting helpers go in `src/lib/`.

## Data & auth

- Use TanStack Query for server state; keep forms local with `useState`.
- Call the API through `apiRequest()` — never raw `fetch` scattered in components.
- JWT lives in `auth-context` + `auth-storage`; attach via `token` option on requests.
- Validate forms with Zod before calling mutations.

## Routing

- Define routes in `src/app/routes.tsx`.
- Protect authenticated pages with `ProtectedRoute`.

## Before done

From repo root: `npm run typecheck && npm run lint` (and `npm run test --workspace=@ai-workflow/frontend` when tests change).

For full architecture workflow, invoke `/frontend-architecture` or read `apps/frontend/.cursor/skills/frontend-architecture/SKILL.md`.
